  const renderOverview=()=>project?<div className="overview scrollable"><div className="overview-top"><div><div className="eyebrow">PROJECT WORKSPACE</div><h1>{project.name}</h1><p>手动确认或指挥 AI 发现依赖，让外部调用留在本地。</p></div><div className="project-emblem"><GitBranch size={32}/></div></div><div className="metric-grid"><div><span>API ENTRIES</span><strong>{project.entries.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><small>Spring MVC Controllers</small></div><div><span>WORKFLOWS</span><strong>{ws!.workflows.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><small>已保存的调用链</small></div><div><span>MOCK RULES</span><strong>{ws!.rules.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</strong><small>{ws!.rules.filter(r=>r.enabled).length} 条启用中</small></div></div><div className="content-label">START WITH AN API<span>{project.build} · Java {project.javaVersion}</span></div><div className="api-cards">{project.entries.map(entry=><button key={entry.id} className="api-card" onClick={()=>analyzeEntry(entry)} disabled={!!busy}><span className={`method-chip ${entry.method.toLowerCase()}`}>{entry.method}</span><div><strong>{entry.path}</strong><small>{entry.className}.{entry.name}()</small></div><span className="analyze-hint">Open Flow <ArrowRight size={15}/></span></button>)}</div><div className="workflow-guide"><div className="content-label">YOUR LOCAL WORKFLOW</div><div>{[['01','Discover','选择 API，发现依赖'],['02','Mock','审核响应与匹配规则'],['03','Verify','运行、调试与恢复']].map(([n,t,d])=><div key={n}><span>{n}</span><strong>{t}</strong><p>{d}</p></div>)}</div></div><div className="project-meta"><Folder size={15}/><code>{project.path}</code><button title="重新索引项目" onClick={()=>void run('重新索引',async()=>{await api('/reindex',{});setSource({});},'索引已更新')}><RefreshCw size={14}/></button></div>{state.problems.length>0&&<button className="notice" onClick={()=>{setBottom(true);setTool('Problems');}}><AlertCircle size={15}/>{state.problems.length} 条索引或分析提示<ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button>}</div>:<div className="welcome"><div className="welcome-bird"><Bird size={50}/></div><div className="eyebrow">JAVA API WORKFLOW STUDIO</div><h1>Your APIs.<br/><span>Your local world.</span></h1><p>从一条 API 开始，理解业务 Flow，<br/>生成、运行并管理每一个下游 Mock。</p><div className="welcome-actions"><button className="primary" onClick={()=>setImportModal(true)}><FolderOpen size={16}/>打开 Java 项目 <kbd>⌘ O</kbd></button><button onClick={()=>importProject(state.samplePath)} disabled={!!busy}><Play size={14}/>体验支付示例</button></div><div className="welcome-features"><span><GitBranch size={15}/>Understand the flow</span><span><Braces size={15}/>Mock with confidence</span><span><History size={15}/>Restore anytime</span></div>{state.recent.length>0&&<div className="recent"><div className="content-label">RECENT PROJECTS</div>{state.recent.slice(0,4).map(r=><button key={r.path} onClick={()=>importProject(r.path)}><Folder size={15}/><strong>{r.name}</strong><small>{r.path}</small><ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button>)}</div>}<span className="welcome-local"><span className="status-dot green"/>Local first · 原始项目源码默认只读</span></div>;
